This round introduces three unused industrial families (zirconia wideband electrochemical O2, Rogowski-coil bus current, beta-attenuation BAM PM) on new invented plants. r46 explicitly distinguished paramagnetic O2 from a zirconia cell and that cell is harvested here as a lead. r54 chilled-mirror is a restage of r51 and is not restaged. r56 is a r52 clone and is not restaged.

Adjacencies declared in-pair then kept physically distinct:
- **175 zirconia O2** is Nernst-pump-current wideband electrochemical O2 of a glass-furnace crown, not r46 paramagnetic dumbbell O2, not r04 CEMS FTIR k-script, not r22 TDLAS NH3, not r15 CRDS HF, not r19 QEPAS, not r52 CLD NOx, not r46 TEOM PM.
- **176 Rogowski coil** is an air-cored dI/dt integrator of an EAF bus, not r25 Faraday FOCT, not r48 MCSA broken-bar, not r52 API-670 proximity orbit, not r17 MEMS accel array, not r25 blade tip-timing.
- **177 BAM PM** is C-14/beta-attenuation mass on a filter tape of a sinter baghouse, not r46 TEOM oscillating-mass, not r40 Kr-85 beta coating thickness, not r31 LII soot fv, not r52 CLD NOx, not opacity-as-SoT.